 style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">규신ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">切斷<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">쳳ˆ등-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">世間<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">세ˋ간ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">迷戀<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">뻬롼ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    kiu-sín chiêt-tng-sè-kân be-loán\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">降伏<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">항헉-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">千百<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">쳰ˉ밯ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">夜叉<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">야체ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">惡鬼<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">억ˆ귀ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    hang-hork-chiēn-pâh-ya-chê ôrk-kùi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">孽鏡台<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1.1em\">꼗걀ˋ대-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">前<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">斟酌<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">짐ˉ젹-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">審判<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">심ˆ퐐</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    giet-kià̰-tai-jiéng jīm-jiôrk-sîm-phoa̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">嚨喉<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">나ᄋᅷˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">出力<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">춛ˆ랃ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">講<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">𣍐<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">出聲<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">춛ˆ샬ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    na-áu chût-lât kông-boe-chût-siâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">大鐵圍山<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1.2em\">대팋ˆ위솰ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">無間地獄<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1.2em\">뿌간ˉ데꼑ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    tai-thîh-wi-soâ̰ bu-kān-te-giêk\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">火燒<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">훼ˆ쇼ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">獄城<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">꼑샬ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">十萬<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">잡빤-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">八千<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">뵣ˆ촁ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    huê-siō-giek-siá̰ jap-ban-poêh-chiêng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">斡頭<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">왇ᄐᅷˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">看<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">콸ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">無<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">뽀ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">來<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">래-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">時<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">시ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">路<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">러ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    oat-tháu khoà̰-bó lai-sí’e lōr\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">明王<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">뼹엉ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">指引<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">지인ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">頭前<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">ᄐᅷ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">光明<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">겅ˉ뼹ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    bieng-óng ji-în-thau-jiéng kōng-biéng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">若<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">나ˉ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">講<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">겅ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">看<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">콸ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">天<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">틸ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">無<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">望<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">빵ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    na-si-kòng, goà khoà̰-thḭ̂ bo-bāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">坦白<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">탄ˆ벻-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">講<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">겅ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">嘛<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">마-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">望<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">빵-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">地<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">되ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">無<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">路<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">러ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    thân-peh-kòng, ma-bang-toē bo-lōr\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一个人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1.1em\">짇에랑ˊ</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">無<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">喙<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">취</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">嘛<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">마-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">無<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">舌<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">짛ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    jit-e-láng, bo-chui ma-bo-jîh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">孤身<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">거ˉ신ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">流轉<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">류좐ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">佇<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">듸-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">北陰酆都<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1em\">박ˆ임ˉ헝ˉ더ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    kōr-sîn liu-joân-ti-pâk-īm-hōng-tôr\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">陰風中<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">임ˉ헝ˉ뎡ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">聽<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">턀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">枵鬼<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">ᄋᆤˉ귀ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">咧<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">爬<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">베ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    īm-hōng-tiông, thiā̰-yāu-kùi lêh-pé\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">심ˉ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">驚驚<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">걀ˉ걀ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">見<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.3em\">길ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">十殿閻君<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1.5em\">잡뎬꺔군ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    sīm-kiā̰-kiâ̰, kḭ̀-jap-tien-giam-kûn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">慐慐<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">껑껑-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">踅<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">셓ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">等<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">단ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">烏白無常<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1em\">어ˉ벻뿌셩ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    gong-gong-sêh, tân-ōr-peh-bu-sióng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">揞腰<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">알ˋ요ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">牽<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">칸ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">攝<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">럅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">亡魂<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">뻥훈ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    à̰-yô khān-goà liâp-goà’e bong-hún\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    &#8220;<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">頭<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">ᄐᅷˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">犁犁<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">레레ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">少年家<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">ᄉᆤˋ롄게ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">欲<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">斡<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">왇-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">去<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">킈ˋ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">底位<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">도ˆ위ˉ</rt></ruby>?</span>&#8221;\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    tháu le-lé’e siàu-lien-kê, lì bêh-oat-khì-tô-wī?\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">滿面<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">뫄ˆ삔ˉ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">風霜<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">헝ˉ성ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">拄<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">두ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">著<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">둏-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">百<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">밯ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">千<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">촁ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">萬<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">빤-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">劫<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">걉</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    moâ-bīn hōng-sông, tû-tioh-pâh-chiēng-ban-kiap\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    &#8220;<ruby style=\"position: relative\">감<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">予<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">허-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">鬼仔<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">귀ˆ아ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">煞<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">쇃</rt></ruby>’둏? <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">櫳仔<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">렁아ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">內面<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">래삔ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">랑ˊ</rt></ruby>.</span>&#8221;\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    kâm-si-hor-kûi-à soah’tioh? long-à lai-bīn’e láng.\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">無<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">名<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">먀ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">無<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">姓<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">셀</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">恬恬<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">댬댬ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">予<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">허-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">擲<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">단ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">佇<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">듸-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">塗跤<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">터카ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    bo-miá bo-sḛ tiam-tiām, hor-láng tàn-ti-thor-khâ\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">凡勢<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">환세</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">意外<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">이ˋ꽈ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">抑<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">얗</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">生<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">셀ˆ</rt></ruby>’래 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">注定<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">주ˋ댤ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    hoan-se si-ì-goā, yah-si-sḛ̂’lai jù-tiā̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\" style=\"position: relative;display: inline-block;vertical-align: baseline;line-height: 1;text-indent: 0;isolation: isolate;white-space: nowrap\">敢逽<rt class=\"tli-rt\" style=\"font-size: var(--tli-ruby-size, 0.55em);position: absolute;top: auto;bottom: calc(100% - var(--tli-ruby-overlap, 0.05em));left: 50%;right: auto;width: max-content;margin: 0;padding: 0;transform: translateX(-50%);line-height: 1.15;text-indent: 0;text-align: center;white-space: nowrap\">갈ˆ나ˆ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一場<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇듈-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">夢<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">빵ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">規<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">귀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">身軀<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">신ˉ쿠ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">輕鬆<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">킨ˉ상ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    kân-nâ-jit-tiṵ-bāng, kūi-sīn-khû khīn-sâng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">火王爺<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">훼ˆ엉야ˊ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">現身<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">혠신ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">目睭<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">빡쥬ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">擘<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">벻ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">金金<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">김ˉ김ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    huê-ong-yá hien-sîn, bak-jiû pêh-kīm-kîm\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">煩惱<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">환로ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">攏<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">烌<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">후ˆ</rt></ruby>’킈 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">無<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">白色<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">벻셱</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">水<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">쥐ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    hoan-lò lông-hû’khi bo-peh-siek’e jùi\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">複製<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">헉ˆ제ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">愛<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">애</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">複製<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">헉ˆ제ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">勇氣<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">영ˆ키</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    hôrk-jè-lì’e ai hôrk-jè-lì’e yông-khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">複製<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">헉ˆ제ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">眼<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">깐ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">複製<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">헉ˆ제ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">靈魂<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">롕훈ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    hôrk-jè-lì’e gàn hôrk-jè-lì’e lieng-hún\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">複製<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">헉ˆ제ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">淚<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">뤼ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">幻化<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">환화ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">阿修羅<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">아ˉ슈ˉ로ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    hôrk-jè-lì’e lūi hoan-hoà-ā-siū-ló\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">代<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">대ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">堪<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">캄ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一切<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">읻ˆ체-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">絕望<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">좓뻥ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">火<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">훼ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    tài-lì khām-ît-chè-joat-bōng’e huè\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">轉輪聖王<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1em\">좐ˆ룬솅ˋ엉ˊ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">起身<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">키ˆ신ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">守護<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">슈ˆ허-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">無<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">名<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">먀-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人客<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">랑켛</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    joân-lun-sièng-óng khî-sîn, siû-hor-bo-mia-lang-kheh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">遠遠<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">흥흥ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">聲<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">샬ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">傳<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">퇀ˊ</rt></ruby>’래, <ruby style=\"position: relative\">이<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">祈求<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">기규ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    hng-hn̄g’e siâ̰ thoán’lai, ī’e ki-kiú\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">眾神<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">졍ˋ신ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">攑<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">꺟-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">燈<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뎽ˉ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">相送<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">쇼ˉ상</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">看顧<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">콸ˋ거ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">有情眾生<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1em\">유ˆ졩졍ˋ솅ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    jiòng-sín giah-tiēng-siō-sang, khoà̰-kòr-yû-jieng-jiòng-siêng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一生<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">읻ˆ솅ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">珠淚<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">주ˉ뤼ˉ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">落塗<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">롷터ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">路邊<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">러빌ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">紅花<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">앙훼ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">清芳<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">촁ˉ팡ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    ît-siêng jū-lūi loh-thór, lor-pḭ̂ ang-huê chiēng-phâng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">佇<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">듸-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">隱痀橋<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">운ˆ구ˉ교ˊ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">終點<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">졍ˉ댬ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">自由<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">주유ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">向望<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">응ˋ빵ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    ti-ûn-kū-kió jiōng-tiàm, si-ju-yú’e ǹg-bāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">望<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">빵-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">會當<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">에당ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">平平安安<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1.5em\">볭볭안ˉ안ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    bang-lì e-tàng-pieng-pieng-ān-ân\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">放<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">방ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">𣍐<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">記<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">기</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人生<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">띤솅ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">有<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">우-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">月娘<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">뀋뉴ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">咧<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">照<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">죠ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">路<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">러ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    pàng-boe-ki’e rin-siêng, u-gueh-niú lêh-jiò-lōr\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">祝<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">젹ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">行<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">걀-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">過<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">궤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一世人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1.1em\">짇시ˋ랑ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">傷悲<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">셩ˉ비ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    jiôrk-lì kia̰-kuè-jit-sì-láng’e siōng-pî\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">拔<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">뷯ˆ</rt></ruby>’퀴 <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">手內<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">츄ˆ래ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">헤<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">縛<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">박ˆ</rt></ruby>’ᄃᆤ에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">鐵鏈<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">팋ˆ롄ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    pûih’khui lî-chiû-lāi hē-pâk’tiau-e thîh-liēn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">無<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">傷<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">셩ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">無<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">痕<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">훈ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">𣍐<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">곻<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">疼<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">턀</rt></ruby>’앟\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    bo-siông bo-hún boe-kôh-thia̰’ah\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">拍<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">팧ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">毋<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">음-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">見<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">길</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">身軀<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">신ˉ쿠ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">攏<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">揣<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">췌-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">倒轉<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">도ˋ등ˋ</rt></ruby>’래\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    phâh-m-kḭ’e sīn-khû lông-chue-tò-tǹg’lai\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">頭前<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">ᄐᅷ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">有<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">우-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">咧<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">等<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">단ˋ</rt></ruby>’릐\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    thau-jiéng u-láng lêh-tàn